'''Movement''' is a [[gem tag]], usually describing [[skill]]s that affect [[movement speed]] or are capable of [[moving]] the user as part of their effect.  

==Mechanics==
Some movement skills, such as {{il|Flame Dash}} or {{il|Leap Slam}}, are instant when you first use them, but have an attack or cast time when used consecutively. The delay before another instant use is reduced by increasing the skill's attack or cast speed.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/2537995#p22125477</ref>

